      "updated": 1745315079026,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "x = x₀ + r * sin(θ) * cos(φ)\ny = y₀ + r * sin(θ) * sin(φ)\nz = z₀ + r * cos(θ)\n\n(x₀, y₀, z₀) le centre de la sphere\nr le rayon de la sphere\nθ = arccos((z - z₀) / r) avec θ ∈ [0; π]\nφ = arctan2(y - y₀, x - x₀) avec φ ∈ [-π; π[",
      "fontSize": 16.50845608292417,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "x = x₀ + r * sin(θ) * cos(φ)\ny = y₀ + r * sin(θ) * sin(φ)\nz = z₀ + r * cos(θ)\n\n(x₀, y₀, z₀) le centre de la sphere\nr le rayon de la sphere\nθ = arccos((z - z₀) / r) avec θ ∈ [0; π]\nφ = arctan2(y - y₀, x - x₀) avec φ ∈ [-π; π[",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5rlgC0tu2uiRQuspS6tD0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1058.180532009967,
      "y": 1015.1879761498587,
      "width": 261.018310546875,
      "height": 20.473466226305504,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9J",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1120711021,
      "version": 533,
