    {
      "id": "rnAx8jHy8KRLwyBopxSya",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1028.3613954979887,
      "y": 2833.46496790422,
      "width": 735.515873015873,
      "height": 247.62684124386254,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFf",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1803041856,
      "version": 2197,
      "versionNonce": 1819358960,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1748002497318,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "x'(φ) = r * sin(θ) * cos'(φ) = - r * sin(θ) * sin(φ)\ny'(φ) = r * sin(θ) * sin'(φ) = r * sin(θ) * cos(φ)\nz'(φ) = 0\n\nφ(v) = 2 * pi * (v - 0.5)\nφ'(v) = 2 * pi\n\nx'(v) = - r * sin(θ) * sin(φ) * 2 * pi = - (y - y₀) * 2 * pi = (y₀ - y) * 2 * pi\ny'(v) = r * sin(θ) * cos(φ) * 2 * pi = (x - x₀) * 2 * pi\nz'(v) = 0\n\nBitangent = ( x'(v), y'(v), z'(v) )",
      "fontSize": 16.50845608292417,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "x'(φ) = r * sin(θ) * cos'(φ) = - r * sin(θ) * sin(φ)\ny'(φ) = r * sin(θ) * sin'(φ) = r * sin(θ) * cos(φ)\nz'(φ) = 0\n\nφ(v) = 2 * pi * (v - 0.5)\nφ'(v) = 2 * pi\n\nx'(v) = - r * sin(θ) * sin(φ) * 2 * pi = - (y - y₀) * 2 * pi = (y₀ - y) * 2 * pi\ny'(v) = r * sin(θ) * cos(φ) * 2 * pi = (x - x₀) * 2 * pi\nz'(v) = 0\n\nBitangent = ( x'(v), y'(v), z'(v) )",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "aD-LxnEZ21ujVDRG5srqi",
