    {
      "id": "23o441rHU-B6liNirKPAy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1030.1947288313224,
      "y": 3167.0470737416445,
      "width": 851.7279942279941,
      "height": 350.8046917621386,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFj",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 606392256,
      "version": 2467,
      "versionNonce": 1441020656,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1748002497318,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Tangent = OP . Bitangent\navec OP le vecteur du centre de la sphere vers le point d'intersection (op et bitangent normalisé)\n\nou\n\nx'(θ) = r * sin'(θ) * cos(φ) = r * cos(θ) * cos(φ)\ny'(θ) = r * sin'(θ) * sin(φ) = r * cos(θ) * sin(φ)\nz'(θ) = r * cos'(θ) = - r * sin(θ)\n\nθ(u) = pi * u\nθ'(u) = pi\n\nx'(u) = r * cos(θ) * cos(φ) * pi = (z - z₀) * cos(φ) * pi\ny'(u) = r * cos(θ) * sin(φ) * pi = (z - z₀) * sin(φ) * pi\nz'(u) = - r * sin(θ) * pi\n\nTangent = ( x'(u), y'(u), z'(u) )",
      "fontSize": 16.50845608292417,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Tangent = OP . Bitangent\navec OP le vecteur du centre de la sphere vers le point d'intersection (op et bitangent normalisé)\n\nou\n\nx'(θ) = r * sin'(θ) * cos(φ) = r * cos(θ) * cos(φ)\ny'(θ) = r * sin'(θ) * sin(φ) = r * cos(θ) * sin(φ)\nz'(θ) = r * cos'(θ) = - r * sin(θ)\n\nθ(u) = pi * u\nθ'(u) = pi\n\nx'(u) = r * cos(θ) * cos(φ) * pi = (z - z₀) * cos(φ) * pi\ny'(u) = r * cos(θ) * sin(φ) * pi = (z - z₀) * sin(φ) * pi\nz'(u) = - r * sin(θ) * pi\n\nTangent = ( x'(u), y'(u), z'(u) )",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "GQI3rjrG3berIDa7zW_Jd",
