      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1748012357411,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "u = (p . right) % 1.0\n\nSi u >= 0\nAlors u ∈ [0, 1]\n\nSi u < 0\nAlors 1 + u ∈ [0, 1[\n\n\nv = (p . up) % 1.0\n\nSi v >= 0\nAlors v ∈ [0, 1]\n\nSi v < 0\nAlors 1 + v ∈ [0, 1[",
      "fontSize": 16.50845608292417,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "u = (p . right) % 1.0\n\nSi u >= 0\nAlors u ∈ [0, 1]\n\nSi u < 0\nAlors 1 + u ∈ [0, 1[\n\n\nv = (p . up) % 1.0\n\nSi v >= 0\nAlors v ∈ [0, 1]\n\nSi v < 0\nAlors 1 + v ∈ [0, 1[",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
