    {
      "id": "Vpu83dSc97QflJFXrXb41",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4756.559754427335,
      "y": 1784.625203696243,
      "width": 908.6771240234375,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHF",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 69447476,
      "version": 364,
      "versionNonce": 1348321932,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1746451624456,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Le conjugate de q(s, x * i, y * j, z * k) est noté q∗ et a pour valeur (s, -x * i, -y * j, -z * k),\nsoit la meme partie scalaire mais la partie imaginaire opposée.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Le conjugate de q(s, x * i, y * j, z * k) est noté q∗ et a pour valeur (s, -x * i, -y * j, -z * k),\nsoit la meme partie scalaire mais la partie imaginaire opposée.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "VIWwPPVxTlo3Pfe2oMM5I",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4750.079705294034,
      "y": 1900.125203696243,
      "width": 476.7156982421875,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2084053556,
      "version": 42,
      "versionNonce": 658175372,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1746451527556,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "|| q || = sqrt(s² + x² + y² + z²)\n|| q || = sqrt(s² - [-x² - y² - z²] + 0)\n|| q || = sqrt(s² - [v . (-v)] + [v ^ (-v)])\n|| q || = sqrt(s² - [v . (-v)] - sv + sv + [v ^ (-v)])\n|| q || = sqrt(q * q∗)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "|| q || = sqrt(s² + x² + y² + z²)\n|| q || = sqrt(s² - [-x² - y² - z²] + 0)\n|| q || = sqrt(s² - [v . (-v)] + [v ^ (-v)])\n|| q || = sqrt(s² - [v . (-v)] - sv + sv + [v ^ (-v)])\n|| q || = sqrt(q * q∗)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "XF__gau50ghmM4MDiHhVL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4754.746371960701,
      "y": 2105.7918703629102,
      "width": 316.3459167480469,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1579129396,
      "version": 84,
      "versionNonce": 1809883404,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1746451533072,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "q * q⁻¹ = q⁻¹ * q = 1\n\n|| q || = sqrt(q * q∗)\n|| q ||² = q * q∗\n|| q ||² / || q ||² = q * q∗ / || q ||²\n1 = q * q∗ / || q ||²\nq⁻¹ * 1 = q⁻¹ * q * q∗ / || q ||²\nq⁻¹ = 1 * q∗ / || q ||²\nq⁻¹ = q∗ / || q ||²",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "q * q⁻¹ = q⁻¹ * q = 1\n\n|| q || = sqrt(q * q∗)\n|| q ||² = q * q∗\n|| q ||² / || q ||² = q * q∗ / || q ||²\n1 = q * q∗ / || q ||²\nq⁻¹ * 1 = q⁻¹ * q * q∗ / || q ||²\nq⁻¹ = 1 * q∗ / || q ||²\nq⁻¹ = q∗ / || q ||²",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5lBB6MPN4QtLr19VOslEe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4754.746371960701,
      "y": 2414.79187036291,
      "width": 818.7392578125,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1981067660,
      "version": 600,
      "versionNonce": 1032990004,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1746451549523,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Soit s' le point apres avoir effectué une rotation d'angle θ de s sur l'axe v.\nSoit p(0, s.x, s.y, s.z) appelé quaternion pur car sa partie scalaire est nulle.\nSoit q(θ, v.x, v.y, v.z) le quaternion représentant la rotation.\n\nt = q * p * q⁻¹\n\nq * p effectue la rotation mais le résultat contient la donnée de l'angle de rotation.\nq⁻¹ enleve la donnée de l'amgle de rotation.\ns' est égale à la partie imaginaire de t.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Soit s' le point apres avoir effectué une rotation d'angle θ de s sur l'axe v.\nSoit p(0, s.x, s.y, s.z) appelé quaternion pur car sa partie scalaire est nulle.\nSoit q(θ, v.x, v.y, v.z) le quaternion représentant la rotation.\n\nt = q * p * q⁻¹\n\nq * p effectue la rotation mais le résultat contient la donnée de l'angle de rotation.\nq⁻¹ enleve la donnée de l'amgle de rotation.\ns' est égale à la partie imaginaire de t.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
