      "text": "u = 1\nv = 0.5 + 0.5 * arctan2(op . right, op . up) / π",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "u = 1\nv = 0.5 + 0.5 * arctan2(op . right, op . up) / π",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "fkyf2U9K9OyYf8W6-PPzH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2614.8059420012887,
      "y": 2073.318555452292,
      "width": 508.63958740234375,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bL0",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2140138736,
      "version": 362,
      "versionNonce": 575521520,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1748005766279,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "u = 0.5 - 0.5 * (op . right) / r\nou (si dans la forme et que la forme est un cylindre)\nu = 0.5 + 0.5 * (op . right) / r\n\nv = 0.5 + 0.5 * (op . up) / r",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "u = 0.5 - 0.5 * (op . right) / r\nou (si dans la forme et que la forme est un cylindre)\nu = 0.5 + 0.5 * (op . right) / r\n\nv = 0.5 + 0.5 * (op . up) / r",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
