      "seed": 1136450403,
      "version": 615,
      "versionNonce": 1269504751,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1748282768281,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Note avec un point R quelconque :\n||m * R|| = ||m * (x, y, z)||\n||m * R|| = ||(m * x, m * y, m * z)||\n||m * R|| = sqrt[(m * x)² + (m * y)² + (m * z)²]\n||m * R|| = sqrt(m² * x² + m² * y² + m² * z²)\n||m * R|| = sqrt[m² * (x² + y² + z²)]\n||m * R|| = sqrt(m²) * sqrt(x² + y² + z²)\n||m * R|| = m * ||R|| ou si m < 0, ||m * R|| = -m * ||R||",
      "fontSize": 10.115354582879068,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Note avec un point R quelconque :\n||m * R|| = ||m * (x, y, z)||\n||m * R|| = ||(m * x, m * y, m * z)||\n||m * R|| = sqrt[(m * x)² + (m * y)² + (m * z)²]\n||m * R|| = sqrt(m² * x² + m² * y² + m² * z²)\n||m * R|| = sqrt[m² * (x² + y² + z²)]\n||m * R|| = sqrt(m²) * sqrt(x² + y² + z²)\n||m * R|| = m * ||R|| ou si m < 0, ||m * R|| = -m * ||R||",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
